# CLAUDE.local.md (personal, this repository only)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` in the repo root. That name is gitignored, so whatever you put in it
applies only to you, in this checkout. Team conventions do NOT belong here: put them in `CLAUDE.md`.

- My local Postgres listens on port 5433, not 5432: `DATABASE_URL=postgres://localhost:5433/acme_dev`.
- I am on the refunds epic this sprint; when unsure where to start, look in `packages/payments/src/refunds/`.
- Keep explanations short; I know this codebase.
